        "content": "## Shortcut Text Transformer\nPOST JSON with type and content. Allowed types: spanish, english, grammar, shorter, longer (lowercase). Select OpenAI credentials on the five OpenAI nodes. One matching branch calls gpt-4o-mini and returns plain text. Unknown operations, empty text, or invalid model output fail the workflow. See README for the Apple Shortcut setup."
